r-kheda\" class=\"block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm\">AC Repair</a>\n                            <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-kheda\" class=\"block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm\">Ducting Services</a>\n                            <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-kheda\" class=\"block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm\">Chiller Services</a>\n                            <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-kheda\" class=\"block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm\">Cold Room</a>\n                            <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-kheda\" class=\"block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm\">HVAC Solutions</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <a href=\"/shop\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 transition\">Shop</a>\n                    <a href=\"/blogs\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 transition\">Blogs</a>\n                    <a href=\"/locations\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 transition\">Locations</a>\n                    <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 transition\">Contact</a>\n                </nav>\n\n                <!-- Mobile Menu Button -->\n                <button class=\"lg:hidden text-2xl text-blue-600\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-bars\"></i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"relative bg-gray-900 text-white py-24 md:py-32\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ducting-repair-service-vadodara-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Ducting Repair Services Kheda Industrial Setup\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30\" title=\"\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-center\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-6 leading-tight\">\n                Ducting Repair Services Kheda\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-gray-200\">\n                Authorized-style precision for Industrial (Goblej, Nadiad, Kapadvanj), Commercial, and Residential HVAC Ducting. Fabrication, Cleaning, and Insulation experts.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141?text=Hi%20Atlas%20Aircon,%20I%20need%20ducting%20repair%20service%20in%20Kheda.\" class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                    <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp text-2xl\"></i> Chat on WhatsApp\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-blue-900 font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt\"></i> Call Now\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INTRO & KEYWORD SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 container mx-auto px-4 content-area\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center\">\n            <div class=\"lg:w-1/2\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800 border-l-4 border-blue-600 pl-4\">\n                    Expert Ducting Repair Services Kheda\n                </h2>\n                <p>\n                    <strong>Ducting Repair Services Kheda</strong> is the cornerstone of efficient climate control for both the growing industrial hubs and residential towns of Kheda district. At Atlas Aircon, we specialize in comprehensive airflow management solutions. Whether you are running a food processing unit in <strong>Nadiad GIDC</strong>, a manufacturing plant in <strong>Goblej</strong>, or managing a residence in Mahemdavad, your HVAC ducts are vital for air quality and energy savings.\n                </p>\n                <p>\n                    The diverse environment of Kheda, from the bustling industrial estates to the serene towns like Dakor, presents unique challenges. Ducts can accumulate agricultural dust or industrial particulate matter, leading to blockages and reduced cooling. Our <strong>ducting repair services Kheda</strong> team uses specialized materials like galvanized iron (GI) and aluminum sheets, along with superior insulation to prevent energy loss. We utilize advanced diagnostic tools to identify blockages and leakages that compromise your system.\n                </p>\n                <p>\n                    From <a href=\"/industrial-ducting-kheda\">Industrial Duct Fabrication</a> for large-scale factories to precise <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-kheda\">HVAC Repair Services</a> for commercial buildings, we cover the entire district. Our locally based technicians ensure rapid response times to Nadiad, Kapadvanj, and Matar, ensuring your production line or home comfort is never compromised.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lg:w-1/2\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ducting-manufacturing-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Ducting Manufacturing and Repair Workshop Kheda\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-2xl w-full h-auto hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PROS AND CONS SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"py-12 bg-gray-100\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-10\">Why Choose Atlas Aircon?</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                <!-- Pros -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border-t-4 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center text-green-700\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle mr-3\"></i> The Advantages</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Local Expertise:</strong> Deep knowledge of Kheda, Nadiad, and Goblej industrial needs.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>24/7 Availability:</strong> Emergency support for factories in Nadiad and Goblej GIDC.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Genuine Spares:</strong> High-grade GI/SS sheets and Class-O insulation used.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Advanced Tooling:</strong> Robotic duct cleaning and laser alignment tools used.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Comprehensive Services:</strong> From fabrication to cleaning and leak proofing.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Cost-Effective:</strong> Transparent pricing with no hidden charges.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Warranty:</strong> Service warranty provided on major repair works.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Cons (Honest transparency) -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border-t-4 border-red-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center text-red-700\"><i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-circle mr-3\"></i> Things to Consider</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Summer Rush:</strong> High demand in May-June may lead to slightly longer wait times for non-emergency residential calls.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Access Required:</strong> Deep duct cleaning requires access to ceiling voids which might be disruptive.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Noise Levels:</strong> Industrial duct fabrication work can be noisy during installation.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Site Prep:</strong> Furniture may need to be covered or moved for residential duct cleaning.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Evaluation Time:</strong> Accurate leakage testing takes time; instant fixes are often temporary.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-red-500 mt-1 mr-2\"></i> <strong>Pricing:</strong> Quality materials cost more than generic market alternatives.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SERVICES WE OFFER SECTION (GRID) -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 container mx-auto px-4\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4\">Comprehensive HVAC &#038; Ducting Solutions</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">We don&#8217;t just fix ducts; we optimize your entire climate control ecosystem. Explore our specialized services available throughout Kheda District.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n            <!-- Service Block 1 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 group\">\n                <div class=\"h-48 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/duct-cleaning-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Duct Cleaning Service Kheda\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-500\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Duct Cleaning Service</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Removal of dust, mold, and chemical residues using rotary brushes and HEPA vacuums. Essential for hospitals and offices.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-kheda\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline\">Read More <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1\"></i></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Service Block 2 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 group\">\n                <div class=\"h-48 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cold-room.webp\" alt=\"Cold Room Repair Service\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-500\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Cold Room Solutions</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">PUF panel ducting and insulation repair for cold storages and pharma warehouses in Nadiad and Goblej.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-kheda\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline\">Read More <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1\"></i></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Service Block 3 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 group\">\n                <div class=\"h-48 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-200\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-snowflake text-6xl text-blue-400\"></i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Central AC Repair</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Fixing air handling units (AHU) and fan coil units (FCU) connected to your central ducting system.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-kheda\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline\">Read More <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1\"></i></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Service Block 4 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 group\">\n                <div class=\"h-48 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rittal-panel-ac-service.webp\" alt=\"Panel AC Repair\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-500\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Panel AC Service</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Specialized ducting and cooling for CNC machines and electrical control panels in Kheda&#8217;s industrial zones.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-kheda\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline\">Read More <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1\"></i></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Service Block 5 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 group\">\n                <div class=\"h-48 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Water-Cooler-Repair-Service-near-me-in-vadodara-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Water Cooler Repair\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-500\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Water Cooler Repair</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Industrial water cooler servicing and installation for factories and commercial complexes.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-kheda\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline\">Read More <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1\"></i></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Service Block 6 -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 group\">\n                <div class=\"h-48 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-200\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-wind text-6xl text-gray-500\"></i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Ventilation &#038; Exhaust</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Design and repair of industrial exhaust systems, fresh air units, and kitchen exhausts.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/air-handling-unit-services-kheda\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline\">Read More <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ml-1\"></i></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- More Links Text -->\n        <div class=\"mt-8 text-center text-sm text-gray-500 space-x-2 content-area\">\n            <span>Also serving:</span>\n            <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-kheda\">Chiller Repair</a> |\n            <a href=\"/ac-service-kheda\">AC Service</a> |\n            <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-kheda\">Deep Freezer Repair</a> |\n            <a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-kheda\">Refrigerator Service</a> |\n            <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-kheda\">HVAC Projects</a>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- BRANDS WE SERVICE -->\n    <section class=\"py-12 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Brands We Service</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center mb-8 text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n                Our technicians are trained to handle ducting and HVAC systems from all major global and local manufacturers. \n                <span class=\"italic text-sm\">(Note: We are a third-party multi-brand service center).</span>\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 items-center opacity-80\">\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Voltas</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Blue Star</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Daikin</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Carrier</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Hitachi</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Mitsubishi</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">LG</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Samsung</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">O-General</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Lloyd</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Panasonic</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-600 transition p-4 border rounded\">Godrej</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center mt-6\">\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-kheda\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\">View all supported AC brands</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PRICING TABLE (WooCommerce Style) -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-10\">Ducting Service Price List Kheda</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto shadow-lg rounded-lg\">\n                <table class=\"min-w-full bg-white price-table text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th class=\"py-4 px-6 font-bold uppercase text-sm border-b\">Service Name</th>\n                            <th class=\"py-4 px-6 font-bold uppercase text-sm border-b\">Unit / Type</th>\n                            <th class=\"py-4 px-6 font-bold uppercase text-sm border-b\">Estimated Price</th>\n                            <th class=\"py-4 px-6 font-bold uppercase text-sm border-b\">Action</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b font-medium\">Basic Duct Cleaning</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">Per Sq. Ft.</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">₹15 &#8211; ₹25</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-sm hover:bg-blue-700\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b font-medium\">Duct Leakage Testing &#038; Sealing</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">Per Joint/Section</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">₹500 &#8211; ₹1500</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-sm hover:bg-blue-700\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b font-medium\">Canvas Connection Replacement</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">Per Unit</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">₹1200 &#8211; ₹2500</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-sm hover:bg-blue-700\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b font-medium\">Insulation Repair (Nitrile/Glasswool)</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">Per Sq. Meter</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">₹250 &#8211; ₹450</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-sm hover:bg-blue-700\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b font-medium\">Grille/Diffuser Cleaning &#038; Alignment</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">Per Piece</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">₹350 &#8211; ₹750</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-sm hover:bg-blue-700\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b font-medium\">Complete System Sanitization</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">Lump Sum (Small Office)</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\">₹5000 onwards</td>\n                            <td class=\"py-4 px-6 border-b\"><a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-sm hover:bg-blue-700\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4 text-center\">* Prices are indicative and subject to site inspection and GST. For a detailed quote, visit <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-kheda\" class=\"text-blue-500 underline\">our complete price list</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- TROUBLESHOOTING / ERROR CODES -->\n    <section class=\"py-12 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Common Ducting Issues &#038; Solutions</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-blue-700\">Diagnostics Guide</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mb-4\">While ducts don&#8217;t have digital error codes, they exhibit physical symptoms. Here is how we diagnose them:</p>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3 list-none\">\n                        <li class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                            <strong>Symptom: Whistling Noise</strong><br>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Usually indicates high static pressure or a gap in the duct joints. Requires sealing or damper adjustment.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-red-500\">\n                            <strong>Symptom: Hot/Cold Spots</strong><br>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Airflow is not reaching certain areas. Could be a crushed flexible duct or disconnected section.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-gray-500\">\n                            <strong>Symptom: Musty Smell</strong><br>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Mold growth inside the duct or insulation due to moisture condensation. Needs deep cleaning and chemical treatment.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n                            <strong>Symptom: High Energy Bills</strong><br>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Leakage in the supply air duct causes cooled air to escape into the false ceiling. Requires leak testing.</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cold-room.webp\" alt=\"Technician inspecting ductwork\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-lg max-h-80 w-full object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREAS SERVED -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-900 text-gray-300\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-10\">We Serve All Areas of Kheda District</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                <!-- Residential -->\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-home mr-2\"></i> Residential Areas</h3>\n                    <div class=\"area-box bg-gray-800 p-4 rounded text-sm leading-relaxed border border-gray-700\">\n                        Kheda City | Nadiad (City &#038; Outskirts) | Mahemdavad | Kapadvanj | Dakor | Matar | Thasra | Kathlal | Mahudha | Galteshwar | Vaso | Kheda Camp Road | Nadiad College Road | Vania Vad (Nadiad) | Santram Mandir Area | Desai Vago | Mission Road | Petlad Road | Dhabhan | Chaklasi | Alina | Kanij | Sarsavani | Traj | Limbasi.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Industrial -->\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry mr-2\"></i> Industrial Areas</h3>\n                    <div class=\"area-box bg-gray-800 p-4 rounded text-sm leading-relaxed border border-gray-700\">\n                        Nadiad GIDC (Phase 1, 2 &#038; 3) | Kheda GIDC | Goblej Industrial Area | Matar GIDC | Kapadvanj GIDC | Mahemdavad Industrial Zone | Mahudha Industrial Area | Kathlal GIDC | Thasra Industrial Estate | Dhabhan Industrial Zone | Piplag Industrial Area (Nadiad) | Kamla Industrial Estate.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-10\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                \n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>How often should ducting be cleaned?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">For residential ACs, every 2-3 years. For industrial zones like Goblej and Nadiad GIDC where dust is high, we recommend annual inspection and cleaning.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>Do you serve industrial areas like Nadiad and Goblej?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide extensive services to all industrial estates including Nadiad GIDC, Kheda GIDC, Goblej, and Matar. Our team is equipped for industrial site visits.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>Can you repair corroded industrial ducts?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Yes. For industrial areas, we can replace damaged sections with corrosion-resistant materials (SS 316 or specialized coatings) and seal leaks effectively.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>Do you fabricate new ducts?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Yes, we have a manufacturing facility for GI (Galvanized Iron) rectangular and spiral ducts, as well as PI (Pre-Insulated) ducts suitable for industrial use.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>What is the price for duct leakage testing?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Pricing depends on the total square footage and accessibility. Please check our <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-kheda\">price list</a> or call us for a site visit quote.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>Why is water dripping from my AC vent?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">This usually happens due to poor insulation causing condensation (sweating) on the duct surface, or a clogged drain pan. We can fix both issues.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>Do you repair kitchen exhaust ducts?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Yes, we specialize in cleaning and repairing oil-laden kitchen exhaust ducts for hotels and canteens to prevent fire hazards.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>Is there a warranty on repairs?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide a service warranty on leakage repairs and fabrication work. The duration depends on the specific service provided.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>Do you work on weekends?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Yes, our team is available 7 days a week to ensure minimum downtime for your business or home comfort.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"faq-details bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg flex justify-between items-center list-none\">\n                        <span>How can I book a service?</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 transition group-open:rotate-180\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">You can call us at +91 97272 57141, use the WhatsApp button on this page, or visit our <a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a> page.</p>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 py-12 border-t-4 border-blue-600\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n                <!-- About -->\n                <div>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Footer Logo\" class=\"h-12 mb-4 bg-white p-1 rounded\" title=\"\">\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\">Atlas Aircon is Kheda&#8217;s leading HVAC and Ducting service provider. We deliver quality, reliability, and expert solutions for all your cooling needs.</p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4 flex space-x-4\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook fa-lg\"></i></a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram fa-lg\"></i></a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\"><i class=\"fab fa-youtube fa-lg\"></i></a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Quick Links -->\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-4\">Quick Links</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\">\n                        <li><a href=\"/home\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Home</a></li>\n    