0\"></i> +91 97272 57141</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope mr-2 text-blue-500\"></i> atlasaircon1@gmail.com</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center\"><i class=\"far fa-clock mr-2 text-blue-500\"></i> Mon-Sun: 9:00 AM &#8211; 9:00 PM</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"border-t border-gray-700 mt-12 pt-8 text-center text-sm\">\n                <p>&copy; 2026 Atlas Aircon. All Rights Reserved. Designed for Excellence.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>",
